34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Um, everyone... I have something to say. I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Oh? Please continue, Mio.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,What?! No way! Takumi is the wolf? That's a huge surprise!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
